# verible.filelist -- the file list verible-verilog-ls reads to learn
# what this design consists of. Paths are relative to THIS directory
# (the one the language server is told is the project root).
#
# reticle reads the same file for its own local module lookup, so
# the editor and the language server agree on one list instead of each
# guessing (see PLAN.md, M56).

pkg/soc_pkg.sv
core/alu.sv
core/regfile.sv
mem/sram_wrapper.sv
bus/axi4_lite_arbiter.sv
top/soc_top.sv
